ative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3028\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\"><img alt=\"APPLe\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\">APPLe</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>绿茵的盛典</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302803</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“和平、反战、博爱、平等”。<br />顶着质疑的声音，顶着恶劣天气带来的泥泞，数十万年轻人涌向同一个山坡。<br />在人们对彼此尚不信任的日子里，这是极例外的一天。当白鸽落在吉他弦上，人类和神秘学家谈论着同一支乐队、模仿同一位歌手，就连一颗果子——一颗鲜美多汁、画着闪电妆的果子，也兴致勃勃地参与其中而未受到任何啃咬。<br />尽管集会的初衷是举办一场纯粹的商业活动，临时租赁的工业用地也并不符合“回归田园”的主旨，但在踏上这片土地之后，一切都显得没那么重要了。<br />尽管去说吧，尽管去用堕落、嘶吼与吉他弦去定义这些思想。要知道，教条天生与摇滚背道而驰。<br />现在，把目光聚焦在这里，丢掉雨伞，甩开外套，跟着我们举起双手——</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ac/Belonging-302804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">偏光太阳镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sunglasses</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />31<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>与星锑的“超酷太阳镜”购置于同一商场的偏光墨镜，价格却大相径庭。嬉皮的圆框造型，加上身为店内现货中最小尺码的特性，是它被一眼相中的仅有原因。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/19/Belonging-302805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">彩色丝带<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ribbon</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一根形状略显抽象的丝带，从经验上来说也可以被当作领带使用。季节性撞色搭配嚎叫的字母，如果丝带可以代替主人说话，那么这就是了。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/04/Belonging-302806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">柯蒂斯的创想<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Curtis' Imagination</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶定制的黑色假发，但对实际穿戴它的对象来说仍然稍显宽大。在略显寻常的质量和造型之外，所有者似乎更重视它在超脱物质的，象征意义上的价值。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 胡士托的回声1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B01.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 胡士托的回声2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%83%A1%E5%A3%AB%E6%89%98%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E5%A3%B02.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E